+    In a linked worktree -- which protocol rule 10 blesses for parallel work
+    (``claude --worktree <ticket-id>``) -- ``REPO_ROOT/.git`` is a POINTER
+    FILE, not a directory, so the previous ``(REPO_ROOT / ".git" / "HEAD")``
+    read raised NotADirectoryError at import time and no test in this package
+    could even be COLLECTED there. ``git rev-parse`` resolves HEAD the same way
+    for a main checkout, a linked worktree, and a packed ref; it takes no locks
